# Generated output is byte-compared by CI to detect a stale render, so the
# working tree must not vary by platform. Without this, a render on Windows
# rewrites every file as LF against a CRLF checkout and the whole repository
# reads as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Except a batch file: cmd's goto and call misread a file with LF endings and
# can land on the wrong line, so it is checked out with the endings cmd expects.
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.woff2 binary
*.min.js -diff
